# Tailwind first

**Never add new layout/look classes to `src/styles.css`.** Style with Tailwind utilities in Svelte/Astro markup, or extract a shared component under `src/lib/components/`.

`styles.css` is only for `@theme` tokens, global base (`html`/`body`/focus/headings), and rare cases Tailwind cannot express.

## Bad

```css
.section-heading {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--space-6);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
```

## Good

```svelte
<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
```

Reuse Tailwind bundles from `src/lib/ui/classes.ts`. Prefer `src/lib/components/ui/Button.svelte` for CTA buttons/links.

Full conventions: see root `AGENTS.md`.
